---
import { Star, Globe, BookOpen } from 'lucide-astro';
---
<!-- ── SLIDE 14: SKILLS — ECOSISTEMA ── -->
<div class="slide" data-index="13">
  <div class="slide-num">14 / 17</div>
  <div class="lbl">Ecosistema</div>
  <div class="title">Skills:<br><em>estructura y comunidad</em></div>

  <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;margin-top:20px;width:100%;max-width:980px;text-align:left;">

    <!-- Columna izquierda: estructura -->
    <div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">
        <BookOpen size={13} /> Anatomía de una SKILL.md
      </div>
      <div class="code" style="margin-top:0;">
        <pre><span class="cm">---</span>
<span class="ca">name</span><span class="cm">:</span>          <span class="cg">daily-standup</span>       <span class="cm"># obligatorio</span>
<span class="ca">description</span><span class="cm">:</span>   <span class="cg">Prepará mi standup</span>  <span class="cm"># obligatorio</span>
<span class="ca">license</span><span class="cm">:</span>       <span class="cb">Apache-2.0</span>
<span class="ca">allowed-tools</span><span class="cm">:</span> <span class="cb">Bash Read Write</span>
<span class="ca">metadata</span><span class="cm">:</span>
  <span class="ca">author</span><span class="cm">:</span>  <span class="cg">tu-usuario</span>
  <span class="ca">version</span><span class="cm">:</span> <span class="cg">"1.0"</span>
<span class="cm">---</span>

<span class="cg">Instrucciones en markdown.</span>
<span class="cg">Sin restricciones de formato.</span>
<span class="cg">Máx 500 líneas recomendadas.</span></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Columna derecha: ecosistema -->
    <div>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:0.62rem;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">
        <Globe size={13} /> Marketplaces y repositorios
      </div>

      <!-- skills.sh -->
      <div class="card" style="padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:0.55rem;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);color:#ccc;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Vercel</span>
          <strong style="font-size:0.88rem;">skills.sh</strong>
        </div>
        <p>El ecosistema abierto más grande. Compatible con 16+ agentes: Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, Gemini, Codex...</p>
        <code style="display:block;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--cyan);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.25);padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;margin-top:8px;">npx skills add owner/repo</code>
      </div>

      <!-- anthropics/skills -->
      <div class="card" style="padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;border-color:rgba(200,85,245,0.18);">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:0.55rem;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(200,85,245,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(200,85,245,0.25);color:var(--purple);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Anthropic</span>
          <strong style="font-size:0.88rem;">anthropics/skills</strong>
          <span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:0.6rem;color:#f59e0b;margin-left:auto;"><Star size={11} /> 110K</span>
        </div>
        <p>Repo oficial de skills de referencia: pdf, xlsx, frontend-design, mcp-builder, claude-api y más.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- agentskills.io -->
      <div class="card" style="padding:14px 16px;border-color:rgba(0,212,255,0.15);">
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px;">
          <span style="font-family:var(--font-m);font-size:0.55rem;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(0,212,255,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(0,212,255,0.2);color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;">Estándar</span>
          <strong style="font-size:0.88rem;">agentskills.io</strong>
        </div>
        <p>Spec abierta y canónica del formato SKILL.md. Compatible con 30+ agentes — no es propietario de OpenClaw.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
